lass=3D"wp-block-heading">Best equipment to make artichoke tacos</h2><p cla=
ss=3D"wp-block-paragraph">The great thing about baking the artichokes for t=
hese vegan street tacos is that anyone with an oven can make them. They don=
=E2=80=99t require the use of a fryer or air fryer and are hands-off whilst=
 cooking. If you want to use an air fryer for this recipe as a healthier al=
ternative to deep frying, then you will need to cook them for around 7-8 mi=
nutes until golden and crispy. Alternatively, fry them in a skillet over me=
dium heat, with half an inch of oil.</p><div style=3D"height:30px" aria-hid=
den=3D"true" class=3D"wp-block-spacer"></div><h2 class=3D"wp-block-heading"=
>How to make vegan fish tacos</h2><p class=3D"wp-block-paragraph">The proce=
