lk first, then gradually add the rest of the milk, followed by the caper br=
ine and lemon juice (this stops the flour from going clumpy).&nbsp;</p><p c=
lass=3D"wp-block-paragraph">You can batter and coat the halved artichoke he=
arts straight away, or you can leave the artichokes to marinade for 10 minu=
tes up to a couple of hours, for a more pronounced flavour.</p><div style=
